    "is_free": false,
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warded Fortress</strong> is a unique combination of survival, base defense, and colony simulation for 1-6 players set in a mysterious fantasy island. Build your fortress and grow your colony in order to defeat the lords of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/137ae97a8b9995db7e36321ce9b627dc.poster.avif?t=1748386921\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/137ae97a8b9995db7e36321ce9b627dc.webm?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/137ae97a8b9995db7e36321ce9b627dc.mp4?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND BUILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you and your colony grow, so does your struggle to survive. Gather materials to build and fortify your fortress. Craft weapons, armor, potions, and various defenses in order to progress and defeat powerful enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/cc18eb41be957e69bf78e3130b706d2a.poster.avif?t=1748386921\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/cc18eb41be957e69bf78e3130b706d2a.webm?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/cc18eb41be957e69bf78e3130b706d2a.mp4?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLONY AND VILLAGERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After creating your colony, you will need to recruit villagers to join the family. Assign villagers to important jobs that you don't want to do and slowly work your way up to an automated colony that runs itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/fe96f800599bf4a29917fa25cbd57daf.poster.avif?t=1748386921\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/fe96f800599bf4a29917fa25cbd57daf.webm?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/fe96f800599bf4a29917fa25cbd57daf.mp4?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOOD MOON DEFENSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood moons will rise and test the strength of you and your fortress. Bolster your defenses and arm yourself with powerful weapons in order to persevere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with up to 6 other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative colony creation where you can create your own colony or join others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building system where you can construct a shelter, village, and entire fortress.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helpful colony system where villagers can be assigned to different jobs and run the colony themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large map with 4 biomes to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and creatures to battle and interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewarding boss fights that will test your strength and skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daunting blood moon wave system that players will need to prepare for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Warded Fortress</strong> is a unique combination of survival, base defense, and colony simulation for 1-6 players set in a mysterious fantasy island. Build your fortress and grow your colony in order to defeat the lords of the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/137ae97a8b9995db7e36321ce9b627dc.poster.avif?t=1748386921\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/137ae97a8b9995db7e36321ce9b627dc.webm?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/137ae97a8b9995db7e36321ce9b627dc.mp4?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>SURVIVE AND BUILD</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you and your colony grow, so does your struggle to survive. Gather materials to build and fortify your fortress. Craft weapons, armor, potions, and various defenses in order to progress and defeat powerful enemies.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/cc18eb41be957e69bf78e3130b706d2a.poster.avif?t=1748386921\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/cc18eb41be957e69bf78e3130b706d2a.webm?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/cc18eb41be957e69bf78e3130b706d2a.mp4?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>COLONY AND VILLAGERS</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After creating your colony, you will need to recruit villagers to join the family. Assign villagers to important jobs that you don't want to do and slowly work your way up to an automated colony that runs itself.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/fe96f800599bf4a29917fa25cbd57daf.poster.avif?t=1748386921\" width=620 height=180 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/fe96f800599bf4a29917fa25cbd57daf.webm?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3534530/extras/fe96f800599bf4a29917fa25cbd57daf.mp4?t=1748386921\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>BLOOD MOON DEFENSE</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Blood moons will rise and test the strength of you and your fortress. Bolster your defenses and arm yourself with powerful weapons in order to persevere.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>KEY FEATURES:</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play alone or with up to 6 other players.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cooperative colony creation where you can create your own colony or join others.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Building system where you can construct a shelter, village, and entire fortress.\u00a0</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Helpful colony system where villagers can be assigned to different jobs and run the colony themselves.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Large map with 4 biomes to explore.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Unique enemies and creatures to battle and interact with.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rewarding boss fights that will test your strength and skill.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Daunting blood moon wave system that players will need to prepare for.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
